       }
      ],
      "text": "WBI:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " PEG-electrolyte solution, dose by age and/or weight, until the rectal effluent is clear (can take many hours or days); usually given via gastric tube."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
